# Vital

Vital owns algorithmic execution. ROLLER and SuperASI stay research.
Jump frontend is the Data Modeling Drive (`?app=jump`). It does not
open Vital or manage bots. Jump Python bot modules remain imported by
Vital until that backend is migrated. Spec: `research/vital/RECON.md`
and `research/vital/OWNERSHIP.md`.

```text
ROLLER = measure
SUPERASI = A Base → B Debase → Final → ITI
VITAL = execution infrastructure
JUMP = DATA MODELING DRIVE
```

Dashboard: `frontend/vital-terminal` on `:5180`.
ROLLER / SuperASI / Jump stay in `frontend/roller-terminal` on `:5179`.
Do not remount Vital inside Jump or the research app.

Phases 2–9 + S are implemented in repo. The live-service integration
proof is `research/vital/LIVE_SERVICE_INTEGRATION.md`. L1–L8 stay
independent. `RUNNING ≠ HEALTHY ≠ EXECUTING`. Do not stop
`momento-live.service` to prove control — demo units only. Do not
place a production test order.
Production systemd writes stay fail-closed (`VITAL_AWS_CONTROL` unset).
Do not SSM start/stop/restart/kill `momento-live.service` unless the
operator explicitly enables control.

## Ownership

- MLB 001 is the first Vital bot (`mlb-001`, alias `mlb-bot-one`).
- Execution stays `apps/trading-engine` + Risk + `strategies/mlb`.
- Jump-AE is that path. Do not build a second engine or second Risk.
- Do not move `apps/trading-engine` or `strategies/mlb`.
- Do not change live FIRST01 / 80/81/83/89.
- Vital owns the MLB 001 execution ledger
  (`research/vital/bots/mlb-001/execution/`). It observes fills and
  reconstructs trades. It does not submit, invent fills, or become a
  second OMS. Recon: `research/vital/EXECUTION_LEDGER_RECON.md`.

## State

Desired ≠ observed ≠ confirmed.

HTTP 200 from a control API is not `RUNNING`. Unread host is
`OBSERVATION_UNAVAILABLE`, not `$0` and not invented `RUNNING`.
Live EV and Sharpe stay `UNAVAILABLE`.
Unread execution history is `OBSERVATION_UNAVAILABLE`, not empty
history and not `$0`.

## ITI

ITI belongs at the end of SuperASI (after Final Results). It is not a
live Kalshi signal. Do not convert `{name}_ITI` into 80/81.

## Absolute

- Browser is not the engine. Browser never submits orders.
- `POST /start` never equals `ENABLE_LIVE_TRADING`.
- Kill = existing host `KILL`. Do not flatten.
- No demo cents added to live cents.
- Secrets never in frontend, `bot.json`, logs, or API bodies.
- Do not start W9 or warehouse Phase 21.
